# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Project Pauli operators onto Hilbert subspaces for the latest version of Sample-based quantum diagonalization (SQD)"
msgstr "I-project ang mga Pauli operator sa mga Hilbert subspace para sa pinakabagong bersyon ng Sample-based quantum diagonalization (SQD)"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Project Pauli operators onto Hilbert subspaces"
msgstr "I-project ang mga Pauli operator sa mga Hilbert subspace"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<OpenInLabBanner notebookPath=\"addons/qiskit-addon-sqd/guides/project-pauli-operators-onto-hilbert-subspaces.ipynb\" />\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We show different ways of projecting a weighted linear combination of Pauli strings\n"
"into a subspace defined by a subset of size $d$ computational basis states. The\n"
"projected operator is stored as a $d \\times d$ ``scipy.sparse.coo_matrix``.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ipinapakita namin ang iba't ibang paraan ng pag-project ng weighted linear combination ng mga Pauli string\n"
"sa isang subspace na tinutukoy ng subset na may sukat na $d$ ng mga computational basis state. Ang\n"
"na-project na operator ay iniimbak bilang isang $d \\times d$ ``scipy.sparse.coo_matrix``.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"As an example, we consider the Hamiltonian of the one-dimensional Heisenberg model with periodic\n"
"boundary conditions and $L = 22$ spins:\n"
"$$\n"
"H = \\sum_{\\langle i, j \\rangle}\\left( \\sigma^x_i\\sigma^x_j + \\sigma^y_i\\sigma^y_j + \\sigma^z_i\\sigma^z_j \\right).\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"Bilang halimbawa, tinitingnan natin ang Hamiltonian ng one-dimensional na Heisenberg model na may periodic\n"
"boundary condition at $L = 22$ na mga spin:\n"
"$$\n"
"H = \\sum_{\\langle i, j \\rangle}\\left( \\sigma^x_i\\sigma^x_j + \\sigma^y_i\\sigma^y_j + \\sigma^z_i\\sigma^z_j \\right).\n"
"$$\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This package provides two tools to perform this projection:\n"
msgstr "Nagbibigay ang package na ito ng dalawang tool para gawin ang projection na ito:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "``qiskit_addon_sqd.qubit.matrix_elements_from_pauli()``: a lower-level function that returns the non-zero matrix elements of a Pauli string and the corresponding indices of the non-zero elements.\n"
msgstr "``qiskit_addon_sqd.qubit.matrix_elements_from_pauli()``: isang lower-level na function na nagbabalik ng mga non-zero na matrix element ng isang Pauli string at ng mga kaukulang index ng mga non-zero na element.\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "``qiskit_addon_sqd.qubit.project_operator_to_subspace()``: a higher-level function that directly returns a ``scipy.sparse`` matrix.\n"
msgstr "``qiskit_addon_sqd.qubit.project_operator_to_subspace()``: a higher-level function that directly returns a ``scipy.sparse`` matrix.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This guide shows how to use these two tools to produce the same sparse operator.\n"
msgstr "Ipinapakita ng gabay na ito kung paano gamitin ang dalawang tool na ito para makabuo ng parehong sparse operator.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Subspace definition {#subspace-definition}"
msgstr "Kahulugan ng subspace {#subspace-definition}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"For this example we generate length-22 random bitstrings. For the projection\n"
"functions to work as expected, it is essential that the bitstrings that define\n"
"the subspace are unique and sorted in ascending order according to their unsigned\n"
"integer representation.\n"
msgstr ""
"Para sa halimbawang ito, gumagawa tayo ng mga random na bitstring na may haba na 22. Para gumana nang tama ang mga projection\n"
"function, mahalagang ang mga bitstring na tumutukoy sa\n"
"subspace ay natatangi at nakaayos nang pataas ayon sa kanilang unsigned\n"
"integer na representasyon.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This can be achieved with the ``qiskit_addon_sqd.qubit.sort_and_remove_duplicates()``\n"
"function.\n"
msgstr "Magagawa ito gamit ang function na ``qiskit_addon_sqd.qubit.sort_and_remove_duplicates()``.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "First method: nonzero matrix elements and indices {#first-method-nonzero-matrix-elements-and-indices}"
msgstr "Unang paraan: mga nonzero na matrix element at index {#first-method-nonzero-matrix-elements-and-indices}"

